# The player's own soundtrack: local, large, and not ours to commit.
music/*
!music/README.md

# Engine samples the player supplies: local, and not ours to commit.
sfx/*
!sfx/README.md

# Packaged distributables — rebuild with tools/package.mjs.
release/

# NOT PUBLISHED, AND DELIBERATELY SO.
#
# ref/  the eight reference frames the critics judged every round against.
#       They are screenshots of somebody else's game (art of rally, Funselektor)
#       and they are the bar, not our work — usable to aim at, not ours to
#       redistribute in a public repository.
# ab/   the A/B panels that pair our frames against those references, which
#       embed them, and run to ~90 MB besides.
# progress/  the live build-progress page. A working instrument, not part of
#       the game, and it is full of the same reference imagery.
ref/
ab/
progress/
